    {
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:43:00.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594582129887019008"
      ],
      "id": "1594582129887019008",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 8,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581128593420289",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "他们的这套打法非常的不可复制，他们是“天时”打法\n但是抓住了天时\n就会付出抓住天时的成本\n\n“所有命运中的馈赠，早已在暗中标好了价格。”\n\n但能学习到的东西还是有很多\n比方说：1. 美宣资源变现 2. medium和小作文能力很重要 3. twitter/官网运营面向的其实不是玩家，而是投资人",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594582129887019008"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:39:01.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594581128593420289"
      ],
      "id": "1594581128593420289",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 4,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581126865391616",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "但其实还是那句话\n怎么来的会怎么还给市场\n\n当你的真实能力无法给社会带来真正巨大的影响\n当你的产品并没有给玩家带来享受和乐趣\n你割了韭菜 赚了大钱\n\n最终还是会被反噬\nstar alta大概率是跟着FTX与SOL一起\n成为了永远不可能面世的伟大雾作\n曾经的梦想和初心都随着沉船而去\n\n最初的选择就是最终的结局",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594581128593420289"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:39:01.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594581126865391616"
      ],
      "id": "1594581126865391616",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 1,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581124210364416",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "启示与落地总结：\n\n没有人能真正抓住最好的时间，star atlas的启动时间是2021年1月，他们也不知道5.19之后还有没有币圈\n但他们还是坚持在做自己认为对的事情\n并且坚持了下来，一直在做事\n最终他们等来了9月的gamefi大牛市\n\n知道怎么和交易所沟通，知道怎么站队，如何择时\n并且选择了坚持",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594581126865391616"
    },
    {
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_1594579717239504897"
        ]
      },
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:39:00.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594581124210364416"
      ],
      "id": "1594581124210364416",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 2,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581118124445696",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "收割结束后，就是维持社区的日常运营【以预期抚平亏损的大家】\n近期开始的pre-alpha，仔细看了一下，确实可能是UE5做的场景，但可惜就是个场景展示，没有玩法系统，大概还得不知道多久的开发周期 https://t.co/CO2PsN01wm",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594581124210364416"
    },
    {
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_1594578025651515392",
          "3_1594578262373830656"
        ]
      },
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:38:59.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594581118124445696"
      ],
      "id": "1594581118124445696",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 1,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581111963025410",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "然后就是他们的代币拉盘策略\n治理代币polis是经典的IEO打法：高FDV和低流通，大概50万-100万美元可以在当时的市场拉30-50倍，最高FDV比动视暴雪市值还高\n\nATLAS币就是赚钱用的，捕获交易磨损\n\n所以是一套经典的美宣资源【星战题材 3A 老外】\n找到了最好的时间【solana爆发 FTX IEO gamefi牛市】 https://t.co/LMYP7eAC2h",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594581118124445696"
    },
    {
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "3_1594577167610175488"
        ]
      },
      "author_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T06:38:57.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1594581111963025410"
      ],
      "id": "1594581111963025410",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1435990322702520320",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 2,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1594581106225184770",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "IEO官宣之后\n开始做买量PR，但是即便如此还是很省钱的\n这个PV大概50秒，成本可能在3-5万人民币上下\n然后借助FTX IEO和 solana之夏的热度\n蹭到了币圈那段时间最重要的风口和概念 https://t.co/twKE1dxM7Q",
      "url": "https://x.com/silverfang88/status/1594581111963025410"
    },
